[G]"Almost persuaded" [Em]now [D]to be[G]lieve;
[G]"Almost persuaded" [D]Christ to re[G]ceive;
[C]Seems now some [G]soul to say,
[D]"Go, Spirit, [G]go Thy way,
[G]Some [Am7]more con[C]venient [G]day
On [D7]Thee I'll [G]call."

"Almost persuaded," come, come today;
"Almost persuaded," turn not away;
Jesus invites you here,
Angels are ling'ring near,
Prayers rise from hearts so dear;
O wand'rer, come!
